T*
(* Bubble Sort: Compares adjacent elements and swaps them if out of order. After pass) Tj
T*
(i, ith largest element bubbles up to final position at end of array. Time Complexity:) Tj
T*
(Best Case O\(N\) \(with swap flag optimization\), Worst/Average Case O\(N^2\). Stable sort.) Tj
T*
(* Selection Sort: Finds minimum element in unsorted subarray and swaps it with first) Tj
